Kubernetes DNS
      ↓
10.96.20.5
      ↓
MySQL Service
      ↓
MySQL Pod

So DNS is like a phone book:
Name                  IP
mysql-service    →    10.96.20.5



How do we check DNS?
Enter a Pod:  kubectl exec -it <pod-name> -- sh
Then:  nslookup mysql-service

If DNS works, you get something like:
Name:      mysql-service.default.svc.cluster.local
