mysql-service
      ↓
DNS found the Service IP
      ↓
10.96.20.5 ✅

If you get:  nslookup: can't resolve 'mysql-service'
then you have a DNS resolution problem.


What is CoreDNS?
Kubernetes normally uses CoreDNS to provide cluster DNS.

Check it:  kubectl get pods -n kube-system
You may see:
coredns-xxxxx    Running
coredns-yyyyy    Running

