Remember this for interview
DNS issue means the Pod cannot convert a Kubernetes Service name, such as mysql-service, into its IP address.
I check DNS from inside the Pod using nslookup, then check CoreDNS if name resolution fails.


You test DNS from inside the application Pod because you want to know:   "Can my application Pod resolve the Service name?"

Example
Suppose:
