mysql-service
      ↓
DNS
      ↓
10.96.20.5

✅ DNS is working.

If it doesn't work
mysql-service
      ↓
DNS ❌
      ↓
cannot resolve
Then you investigate CoreDNS, DNS configuration, or NetworkPolicy.



You may see:
coredns-7db6d8ff4d-abc12
coredns-7db6d8ff4d-xyz34

Those are Pods.
So when you run:  kubectl rollout restart deployment coredns -n kube-system
